<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Dear Lord, I will offer myself willingly</l><l>In the day of Your warfare;</l><l>Dear Lord, I will offer myself willingly</l><l>In the day of Your warfare,</l><l>In the splendor of fresh consecration.</l><l>As young men we’ll be like dew to You</l><l>Of our generation.</l><l>We will be the brook to water You, Lord,</l><l>As You take th’ lead to fight through to the end;</l><l>You will lift up Your head.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
